WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:03.875
Unit twenty-five. My Healthy Week!

2
00:00:04.837 --> 00:00:08.379
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.429 --> 00:00:12.165
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.215 --> 00:00:15.817
Today we learn about My Healthy Week. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.502 --> 00:00:19.585
Plan. Say it with me. Plan!

6
00:00:23.091 --> 00:00:26.691
Healthy. Say it with me. Healthy!

7
00:00:30.190 --> 00:00:33.490
Water. Say it with me. Water!

8
00:00:36.989 --> 00:00:40.322
Sleep. Say it with me. Sleep!

9
00:00:43.822 --> 00:00:47.138
Play. Say it with me. Play!

10
00:00:50.642 --> 00:00:53.792
Fruit. Say it with me. Fruit!

11
00:00:57.299 --> 00:01:00.865
Wash. Say it with me. Wash!

12
00:01:04.376 --> 00:01:07.676
Goal. Say it with me. Goal!

13
00:01:11.166 --> 00:01:19.464
I can plan a healthy week. I drink water, eat fruit, wash my hands, play every day, and sleep early. I choose one goal to try each week.

14
00:01:19.514 --> 00:01:20.753
I can do that too!

15
00:01:22.175 --> 00:01:27.411
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:27.461 --> 00:01:28.611
Water!

17
00:01:29.333 --> 00:01:34.618
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:34.668 --> 00:01:35.818
Wash!

19
00:01:36.686 --> 00:01:41.925
Did you know? Small healthy steps every day add up to big changes!

20
00:01:41.975 --> 00:01:44.133
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:44.818 --> 00:01:52.616
Think and answer. What healthy goal will you try this week?

22
00:01:52.666 --> 00:01:53.816
Great answer!

23
00:01:54.854 --> 00:02:02.626
Wonderful work, everyone! You finished Health Grade 2. Keep your healthy habits, and see you in Grade 3. Goodbye!

24
00:02:02.676 --> 00:02:05.776
Thank you, Nurse Bopha! See you in Grade 3!

